<title>USA: Tele-Communications, Adelphia in pact.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications, Adelphia in pact.</headline>
<dateline>COUDERSPORT, Pa. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc and Adelphia Communications Corp said on Friday that they had signed a letter of intent to pool selected cable systems serving nearly 465,000 customers in the Buffalo region.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, TCI and Adelphia will pool several regional cable systems, providing cable customers with a combined operation, the companies said.</p>
<p>TCI will hold a minority interest in the partnership and Adelphia will manage the partnership and consolidate the partnership's results for financial reporting purposes, they added.</p>
<p>Further terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
